          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Breakfirst Games, Just For Games and PID Games are pleased to unveil various activities to find out in the upcoming INSTANT SPORTS Winter Games, the newest episode from the INSTANT SPORTS franchise displaying 7 surprising winter sports.\n\nThe game will be available on Nintendo Switch from Fall 2021.",
